  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.9,
      "end": 4.18,
      "en": "Hello English learners, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "您好英语学习者，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.4,
      "end": 4.92,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.22,
      "end": 5.8,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.4,
      "end": 8.42,
      "en": "And today we're bringing you a great office lesson.",
      "zh": "今天我们为您带来一个很棒的办公室课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 8.76,
      "end": 13.7,
      "en": "That's right, but actually I hope this situation never happens to any of our listeners.",
      "zh": "没错，但实际上我希望这种情况永远不会发生在我们的任何听众身上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 14.62,
      "end": 14.94,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 15.56,
      "end": 17.36,
      "en": "Today we are firing somebody.",
      "zh": "今天我们要解雇某人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 17.36,
      "end": 18.36,
      "en": "Yikes.",
      "zh": "哎呀。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 18.36,
      "end": 25.02,
      "en": "It is a little bit complicated, but maybe you're an HR manager, maybe you are a supervisor, and you'll have to do this one day.",
      "zh": "这有点复杂，但也许你是一名人力资源经理，也许你是一名主管，你必须有一天这样做。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 25.24,
      "end": 27.2,
      "en": "So got to learn how, right?",
      "zh": "所以要学会怎么做，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 27.2,
      "end": 28.2,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 28.2,
      "end": 29.2,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 29.2,
      "end": 34.0,
      "en": "Let's get started then as we listen to Isabel and Anthony.",
      "zh": "让我们开始听伊莎贝尔和安东尼的声音。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 38.92,
      "en": "Hi Isabel.",
      "zh": "嗨，伊莎贝尔。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 38.92,
      "end": 47.8,
      "en": "You wanted to see me?",
      "zh": "你想见我吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 48.01,
      "end": 49.23,
      "en": "Yes, Anthony.",
      "zh": "是的，Anthony。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 49.77,
      "end": 51.25,
      "en": "Come on in and have a seat.",
      "zh": "进来坐下吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 54.29,
      "end": 55.19,
      "en": "Is everything okay?",
      "zh": "一切都还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 55.67,
      "end": 57.05,
      "en": "You seem a bit preoccupied.",
      "zh": "你好像有点心事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 58.03,
      "end": 62.03,
      "en": "Well, Anthony, this is not going to be an easy conversation.",
      "zh": "安东尼，接下来的话不太好说。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 62.67,
      "end": 67.07,
      "en": "The company has made some decisions which will have a direct impact on your employment.",
      "zh": "公司做了些决定，会直接影响你的工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 67.77,
      "end": 68.15,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 69.35,
      "end": 72.47,
      "en": "I don't want to beat around the bush, so I'm just going to come out with it.",
      "zh": "我就不拐弯抹角了，直说吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 72.99,
      "end": 74.21,
      "en": "We're going to have to let you go.",
      "zh": "我们不得不解雇你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 75.2,
      "end": 75.58,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 75.92,
      "end": 76.22,
      "en": "Why?",
      "zh": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 76.8,
      "end": 78.68,
      "en": "I mean, just like that?",
      "zh": "就这么突然？"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 78.78,
      "end": 79.04,
      "en": "I'm fired?",
      "zh": "我被解雇了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 79.88,
      "end": 83.46,
      "en": "I'm sorry, but to be honest, you're a terrible employee.",
      "zh": "我很抱歉，但老实说，你是一个糟糕的员工。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 84.2,
      "end": 84.38,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 85.4,
      "end": 86.52,
      "en": "I resent that.",
      "zh": "这话我可不认。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 87.02,
      "end": 91.04,
      "en": "Anthony, you were caught making international calls from the office phone.",
      "zh": "你被发现用公司电话打国际长途。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 91.6,
      "end": 97.02,
      "en": "You called in sick eight times this month, and you smell like alcohol.",
      "zh": "这个月你请了八次病假，而且身上还有酒味。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 104.52,
      "end": 107.13,
      "en": "He did sound a little bit like he had too much to drink.",
      "zh": "他听起来确实有点像他喝得太多了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 107.32,
      "end": 108.32,
      "en": "I know.",
      "zh": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 108.32,
      "end": 109.32,
      "en": "He had that kind of-",
      "zh": "他有那种——"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 109.32,
      "end": 109.63,
      "en": "Slur.",
      "zh": "口齿不清。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 110.32,
      "end": 111.32,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 111.32,
      "end": 115.57,
      "en": "That slow way of talking that made him seem a little bit drunk.",
      "zh": "这种缓慢的谈话方式让他看起来有点醉了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 121.77,
      "en": "Well, that's definitely something you don't want to do is show up to work with alcohol in your breath.",
      "zh": "这绝对是你不想做的事——带着酒气来上班。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 122.36,
      "end": 123.36,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 123.36,
      "end": 124.36,
      "en": "But you know what?",
      "zh": "不过你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 124.36,
      "end": 127.95,
      "en": "There's a lot of great language in this dialogue, so why don't we take a look at it now in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "这个对话中有很多很棒的语言，所以我们为什么不现在在语言要点中看看它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 130.4,
