      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 131.4,
      "end": 132.4,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 132.97,
      "end": 134.79,
      "en": "Well, I want to look at three words here.",
      "zh": "好吧，我想在这里看三个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 135.04,
      "end": 139.08,
      "en": "Now, the first one, Anthony said that Isabel was preoccupied.",
      "zh": "现在，第一个，安东尼说伊莎贝尔心事重重。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 139.08,
      "end": 140.08,
      "en": "Preoccupied.",
      "zh": "心事重重的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 140.08,
      "end": 140.27,
      "en": "Preoccupied.",
      "zh": "心事重重的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 142.07,
      "end": 142.23,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 142.31,
      "end": 143.93,
      "en": "So, if somebody is preoccupied-",
      "zh": "所以，如果一个人心事重重——"
    },
