      "end": 149.76,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 149.76,
      "end": 152.71,
      "en": "Why don't we take a listen to a few examples of how this word is used?",
      "zh": "我们为什么不听听一些关于如何使用这个词的例子？"
