      "id": 58,
      "start": 158.2,
      "end": 159.44,
      "en": "James is really preoccupied.",
      "zh": "詹姆斯心事重重。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 160.06,
      "end": 161.9,
      "en": "I think he's having some family problems.",
