    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 188.16,
      "end": 194.66,
      "en": "So, again, Isabel told Anthony that the decision will have a direct impact on his career.",
      "zh": "所以，伊莎贝尔再次告诉安东尼，这个决定将对他的职业生涯产生直接影响。"
    },
    {
