      "end": 579.16,
      "en": "Is there a special color for pink slips?",
      "zh": "pink slip 有专门的颜色吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 579.84,
      "end": 585.63,
      "en": "If you guys have any stories as well, maybe about being fired or maybe you've had to fire somebody.",
      "zh": "如果你们也有任何故事，也许是关于被解雇，或者你不得不解雇某人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 586.56,
      "end": 588.21,
      "en": "Come to our website and tell us about it.",
      "zh": "来我们的网站告诉我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 588.64,
      "end": 589.64,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 589.64,
      "end": 590.64,
      "en": "EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "EnglishPod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 590.64,
      "end": 591.61,
      "en": "There you can leave your questions and comments.",
      "zh": "在那里你可以留下你的问题和评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 591.89,
      "end": 596.79,
      "en": "Erica and I are always there trying to answer your questions and also our great community is there.",
      "zh": "Erica 和我一直在那里试图回答你的问题，我们伟大的社区也在那里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 597.44,
      "end": 598.44,
      "en": "They will also help.",
      "zh": "他们也会提供帮助。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 598.44,
      "end": 599.44,
      "en": "Okay, guys.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 599.44,
      "end": 599.95,
      "en": "Well, we're out of time for today.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们今天没有时间了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 600.44,
      "end": 601.27,
      "en": "But until next time.",
      "zh": "但直到下一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 601.44,
      "end": 602.44,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 602.44,
      "end": 610.508,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
